<LanguageData>
  <!--EN: Also known as “liquid sunshine” ambrandy is a twice-fermented, distilled liquor of the highest calibre. Glitterworld aristocrats are known to send entire private militias to assist in shipping singular bottles.\n\nBeyond being flavorful enough to bring one to tears, studies have found this liquor when deeply aged causes increased stimulation in the section of the human brain known for artistic creativity and expression while also dampening the section of the brain in control of emotions.\n\nEven the bottle itself is a beauty to behold, when hit with even the tiniest amount of light golden flecks are seen dancing in the liquid within, like embers rising from a campfire. While Ambrandy can be mixed into cocktails, those few who have had the privilege to drink it say it is best on its own.-->
  <VBE_Ambrandy.description>龙涎香也被称为“液体阳光”，是一种经过两次发酵的最高品质蒸馏酒。众所周知，闪闪发光的世界贵族会派遣整个私人民兵协助运送奇异的瓶子。

除了味道鲜美到让人落泪之外，研究发现，这种酒在陈年后会对人类大脑以艺术创造力和表达能力而闻名的部分产生更大的刺激，同时也会削弱大脑控制的部分

就连瓶子本身也很美丽，当受到哪怕是最微小的浅金色斑点的撞击时，都会看到在里面的液体中跳舞，就像篝火中升起的余烬一样。虽然龙涎香可以混合到鸡尾酒中，但少数有幸喝过它的人表示，单独饮用龙涎香效果最好。</VBE_Ambrandy.description>
  <!--EN: Drink {0}-->
  <VBE_Ambrandy.ingestible.ingestCommandString>喝{0}</VBE_Ambrandy.ingestible.ingestCommandString>
  <!--EN: Drinking {0}.-->
  <VBE_Ambrandy.ingestible.ingestReportString>饮酒 {0}。</VBE_Ambrandy.ingestible.ingestReportString>
  <!--EN: ambrandy-->
  <VBE_Ambrandy.label>龙涎香</VBE_Ambrandy.label>
  <!--EN: A gilded distillery of very delicate craftsmanship meant for aging ambrosia must into a drinkable form.-->
  <VBE_AmbrandyDistillery.description>一家镀金的酿酒厂，工艺非常精致，旨在将仙草陈酿成可饮用的形式。</VBE_AmbrandyDistillery.description>
  <!--EN: ambrandy distillery-->
  <VBE_AmbrandyDistillery.label>安布兰迪酿酒厂</VBE_AmbrandyDistillery.label>
  <!--EN: Sliced and pressed ambrosia, can be left alone to ripen into must to be further distilled into an extremely fine liquor.-->
  <VBE_AmbrandyMush.description>切片和压榨的豚草，可以单独放置，使其成熟成葡萄汁，然后进一步蒸馏成极优质的酒。</VBE_AmbrandyMush.description>
  <!--EN: ambrosia mush-->
  <VBE_AmbrandyMush.label>豚草糊</VBE_AmbrandyMush.label>
  <!--EN: Fully ripened ambrosia liquified into essentially a thick juice and left alone to grow bacteria for fermenting. Ready to be distilled into a drinkable form.-->
  <VBE_AmbrandyMust.description>完全成熟的豚草基本上液化成浓稠的汁液，并留下来培养细菌进行发酵。准备蒸馏成可饮用的形式。</VBE_AmbrandyMust.description>
  <!--EN: ambrandy must-->
  <VBE_AmbrandyMust.label>龙涎香必须</VBE_AmbrandyMust.label>
  <!--EN: A somewhat ornate countertop stocked to the brim with different vessels and devices for making a variety of drinks. An ice box, a series of taps, hoses, and carbonators means anybody tending it can brew much quicker than at a rudimentary brewery.-->
  <VBE_Bar.description>有点华丽的台面，堆满了用来制作各种饮料的不同容器和设备。一个冰盒、一系列水龙头、软管和碳酸化器意味着任何人都可以比在简陋的啤酒厂更快地酿造啤酒。</VBE_Bar.description>
  <!--EN: bar-->
  <VBE_Bar.label>酒吧</VBE_Bar.label>
  <!--EN: A small, rolled paper tube stuffed loosely with tobacco leaves. Offers a brief euphoria as well as mental stimulation, and is very addictive. The pungent odor is generally disliked at first, but becomes much more pleasurable as the smoker becomes more addicted. Can be crafted without equipment, at a crafting spot.-->
  <VBE_Cigarettes.description>一张小卷纸管，松散地塞满了烟叶。提供短暂的欣快感和精神刺激，并且非常容易上瘾。刺鼻的气味一开始通常令人不喜欢，但随着吸烟者上瘾的程度增加，它会变得更加令人愉悦。无需设备即可在制作点制作。</VBE_Cigarettes.description>
  <!--EN: Smoke {0}-->
  <VBE_Cigarettes.ingestible.ingestCommandString>烟雾 {0}</VBE_Cigarettes.ingestible.ingestCommandString>
  <!--EN: Smoking {0}.-->
  <VBE_Cigarettes.ingestible.ingestReportString>吸烟{0}。</VBE_Cigarettes.ingestible.ingestReportString>
  <!--EN: cigarettes-->
  <VBE_Cigarettes.label>香烟</VBE_Cigarettes.label>
  <!--EN: A fat, dried tobacco leaf stuffed to the brim with more tobacco leaves and a gold foil wrap around it. Cigars have a historically posh presentation and are usually only affordable by those who mingle with glitterworld elite regularly. Cigars are often flavored with citrus or vanilla to make their flavor and odor less acrid.-->
  <VBE_Cigars.description>肥厚的干烟叶，里面塞满了更多的烟叶，周围还包裹着金箔。雪茄有着历史上豪华的外观，通常只有那些经常与闪闪发光的世界精英交往的人才能买得起。雪茄通常用柑橘或香草调味，以使其味道和气味不那么辛辣。</VBE_Cigars.description>
  <!--EN: Smoke {0}-->
  <VBE_Cigars.ingestible.ingestCommandString>烟雾 {0}</VBE_Cigars.ingestible.ingestCommandString>
  <!--EN: Smoking {0}.-->
  <VBE_Cigars.ingestible.ingestReportString>吸烟{0}。</VBE_Cigars.ingestible.ingestReportString>
  <!--EN: cigars-->
  <VBE_Cigars.label>雪茄</VBE_Cigars.label>
  <!--EN: The result of whiskey being aged once more in an unused or lightly used secondary barrel. Flavor profiles are stronger and the afterburn in one's throat notably reduced. The increased aging time for fine whiskey generally portrays a sense of mercantilism and class among its consumers.-->
  <VBE_DoubleWhiskey.description>威士忌在未使用或轻度使用的辅助桶中再次陈酿的结果。味道更加浓郁，喉咙里的后烧感明显减少。优质威士忌陈酿时间的延长通常在消费者中体现出重商主义和班级。</VBE_DoubleWhiskey.description>
  <!--EN: Drink {0}-->
  <VBE_DoubleWhiskey.ingestible.ingestCommandString>喝{0}</VBE_DoubleWhiskey.ingestible.ingestCommandString>
  <!--EN: Drinking {0}.-->
  <VBE_DoubleWhiskey.ingestible.ingestReportString>饮酒 {0}。</VBE_DoubleWhiskey.ingestible.ingestReportString>
  <!--EN: double-aged whiskey-->
  <VBE_DoubleWhiskey.label>双陈年威士忌</VBE_DoubleWhiskey.label>
  <!--EN: A sour and fizzy drink finished off with a hint of bitterness. The combination of sugar and caffeine means a burst of energy upfront, but with a crash later. Notable aftertaste of radiation.-->
  <VBE_EnergyDrink.description>一杯酸酸的碳酸饮料结束时带有一丝苦味。糖和咖啡因的结合意味着前期能量爆发，但随后就会崩溃。明显的辐射余味。</VBE_EnergyDrink.description>
  <!--EN: Drink {0}-->
  <VBE_EnergyDrink.ingestible.ingestCommandString>喝{0}</VBE_EnergyDrink.ingestible.ingestCommandString>
