  <!--EN: energy drink-->
  <VBE_EnergyDrink.label>能量饮料</VBE_EnergyDrink.label>
  <!--EN: A fine complex cocktail, mixed precisely from multiple ingredients.-->
  <VBE_FineCocktail.description>精致的复合物鸡尾酒，由多种成分精确混合而成。</VBE_FineCocktail.description>
  <!--EN: fine cocktail-->
  <VBE_FineCocktail.label>很好鸡尾酒</VBE_FineCocktail.label>
  <!--EN: A particularly mild and colorless spirit, aromatically speaking this bottle has a pine-tree like scent as well as subtle fruity notes. This liquor has a reputation for being light-hearted and fun to drink and for causing what is known as  “gin drunkenness”, during which one feels increased empathy and understanding.-->
  <VBE_Gin.description>这是一种特别温和、无色的烈酒，从芳香上来说，这瓶酒具有类似松树的香味以及微妙的果香。这种酒以喝起来轻松、有趣而闻名，并且会引起所谓的“杜松子酒醉酒”，在此期间人们会感到同情和理解增加。</VBE_Gin.description>
  <!--EN: Drink {0}-->
  <VBE_Gin.ingestible.ingestCommandString>喝{0}</VBE_Gin.ingestible.ingestCommandString>
  <!--EN: Drinking {0}.-->
  <VBE_Gin.ingestible.ingestReportString>饮酒 {0}。</VBE_Gin.ingestible.ingestReportString>
  <!--EN: gin-->
  <VBE_Gin.label>杜松子酒</VBE_Gin.label>
  <!--EN: A clear but cloudy mixture of juiced berries and miscellaneous grain, ready to be fermented.-->
  <VBE_GinMush.description>一种清澈但浑浊的果汁浆果和杂粮混合物，准备发酵。</VBE_GinMush.description>
  <!--EN: gin mush-->
  <VBE_GinMush.label>杜松子酒糊</VBE_GinMush.label>
  <!--EN: A fully metal industrial distilling device, meant to purify and ferment gin into a drinkable form. The metallic design means aging is possible in a wide range of temperatures and conditions.-->
  <VBE_GinStill.description>一种全金属工业蒸馏设备，旨在将杜松子酒净化并发酵成可饮用的形式。金属设计意味着可以在各种温度和条件下进行老化。</VBE_GinStill.description>
  <!--EN: gin still-->
  <VBE_GinStill.label>杜松子酒</VBE_GinStill.label>
  <!--EN: A veritable miracle of mixology. This cocktails every factor from temperature of glass, choice of stirring instrument and type of garnish has been precisely calculated for the maximum flavor and body possible.-->
  <VBE_GourmetCocktail.description>名副其实的调酒奇迹。这种鸡尾酒的每一个因素，从玻璃的温度、搅拌工具的选择和装饰类型都经过精确计算，以尽可能获得最大的风味和酒体。</VBE_GourmetCocktail.description>
  <!--EN: gourmet cocktail-->
  <VBE_GourmetCocktail.label>美食鸡尾酒</VBE_GourmetCocktail.label>
  <!--EN: A warm, bitter beverage usually complemented with milk and sugar. A favorite among students and office workers across the galaxy due to high caffeine content and pleasing aroma.-->
  <VBE_HotCoffee.description>一种温热的苦味饮料，通常搭配牛奶和糖。由于咖啡因含量高且香气宜人，深受整个银河系学生和上班族的喜爱。</VBE_HotCoffee.description>
  <!--EN: Drink {0}-->
  <VBE_HotCoffee.ingestible.ingestCommandString>喝{0}</VBE_HotCoffee.ingestible.ingestCommandString>
  <!--EN: Drinking {0}.-->
  <VBE_HotCoffee.ingestible.ingestReportString>饮酒 {0}。</VBE_HotCoffee.ingestible.ingestReportString>
  <!--EN: coffee-->
  <VBE_HotCoffee.label>咖啡</VBE_HotCoffee.label>
  <!--EN: An icy, chilled coffee. Chilling coffee is preferred by many in warmer climates, anecdotally it also smooths out bitter flavors and brings out subtle nuttiness. Just like its warm counterpart, it is ubiquitous among students and professionals alike across the galaxy.-->
  <VBE_IceCoffee.description>一杯冰镇、冰镇的咖啡。在温暖的气候下，冰镇咖啡是许多人的首选，据说它还能消除苦味并带出微妙的坚果味。就像它的温暖对应物一样，它在整个银河系的学生和专业人士中无处不在。</VBE_IceCoffee.description>
  <!--EN: Drink {0}-->
  <VBE_IceCoffee.ingestible.ingestCommandString>喝{0}</VBE_IceCoffee.ingestible.ingestCommandString>
  <!--EN: Drinking {0}.-->
  <VBE_IceCoffee.ingestible.ingestReportString>饮酒 {0}。</VBE_IceCoffee.ingestible.ingestReportString>
  <!--EN: iced coffee-->
  <VBE_IceCoffee.label>冰咖啡</VBE_IceCoffee.label>
  <!--EN: Juiced fruit, tart and tangy, can be made from a singular fruit or a mixed variety - Also known as a juice medley. Many drinks can be brewed or mixed using juices as base. While no more nutritious than non juiced fruit it is much easier to store and transport.-->
  <VBE_Juice.description>果汁水果，酸而浓烈，可以由单一水果或混合品种制成 - 也称为混合果汁。许多饮料可以用果汁作为基础来酿造或混合。虽然不比不榨汁的水果更有营养，但更容易储存和运输。</VBE_Juice.description>
  <!--EN: juice-->
  <VBE_Juice.label>汁</VBE_Juice.label>
  <!--EN: A masterpiece of bartending incarnate, this cocktail was mixed from a wide variety of ingredients and chilled to perfection before meticulously shaken and served.-->
  <VBE_LavishCocktail.description>这款鸡尾酒是调酒界的杰作，由多种原料混合而成，并在精心摇匀和饮用之前冷藏至完美。</VBE_LavishCocktail.description>
  <!--EN: lavish cocktail-->
  <VBE_LavishCocktail.label>奢华鸡尾酒</VBE_LavishCocktail.label>
  <!--EN: A low-lying bush of tropical origin, dotted by small reddish berries when fully grown. The pits of these berries are known succinctly as “coffee beans” and can be roasted to bring out a robust and bitter flavor, as well as natural caffeine. This particular genus has been selectively bred for quick maturing compared to its ancient counterpart.-->
  <VBE_Plant_Coffee.description>一种原产于热带的低洼灌木丛，完全生长后点缀着红色的小浆果。这些浆果的果核被简称为“咖啡豆”，可以烘烤以带来浓郁而苦涩的味道以及天然咖啡因。与古代同类相比，这个特殊的属经过选择性培育，可以快速成熟。</VBE_Plant_Coffee.description>
  <!--EN: coffee plant-->
  <VBE_Plant_Coffee.label>咖啡厂</VBE_Plant_Coffee.label>
  <!--EN: A very leafy shrub that is particularly easy to cultivate. Since early mankind it was discovered the leaves of these plants can be boiled into a variety of earthy and soothing tea. This particular genus has been selectively bred for quick maturing compared to its ancient counterpart.-->
  <VBE_Plant_Tea.description>一种特别容易栽培的多叶灌木。自从早期人类发现这些植物的叶子可以煮成各种泥土和舒缓的茶。与古代同类相比，这个特殊的属经过选择性培育，可以快速成熟。</VBE_Plant_Tea.description>
  <!--EN: tea grass-->
  <VBE_Plant_Tea.label>tea 草</VBE_Plant_Tea.label>
  <!--EN: A short, broad-leafed plant that thrives in warm climates. Tobacco leaves can be dried quite easily to then be rolled and smoked, providing a mild stimulating effect.-->
  <VBE_Plant_Tobacco.description>一种短而阔叶的植物，在温暖的气候下茁壮成长。烟叶可以很容易地干燥，然后卷起来熏，提供温和的刺激效果。</VBE_Plant_Tobacco.description>
  <!--EN: tobacco plant-->
  <VBE_Plant_Tobacco.label>烟草植物</VBE_Plant_Tobacco.label>
  <!--EN: The pits of coffee plant berries, known succinctly as “coffee beans”. They can be roasted to bring out a robust and bitter flavor, as well as natural caffeine.-->
  <VBE_RawCoffee.description>咖啡植物浆果的果核，简称为“咖啡豆”。它们可以经过烘焙以产生浓郁的苦味以及天然咖啡因。</VBE_RawCoffee.description>
  <!--EN: coffee beans-->
  <VBE_RawCoffee.label>咖啡豆</VBE_RawCoffee.label>
  <!--EN: The leaves of the tea plant. They can be boiled into a variety of earthy and soothing beverages.-->
  <VBE_RawTea.description>茶树的叶子。它们可以煮成各种朴实且舒缓的饮料。</VBE_RawTea.description>
  <!--EN: tea leaves-->
  <VBE_RawTea.label>茶叶</VBE_RawTea.label>
  <!--EN: The leaves of the tobacco plant. Tobacco leaves can be dried quite easily to then be rolled and smoked, providing a mild stimulating effect.-->
  <VBE_RawTobacco.description>烟草植物的叶子。烟叶可以很容易地干燥，然后卷起来熏，提供温和的刺激效果。</VBE_RawTobacco.description>
  <!--EN: tobacco leaves-->
  <VBE_RawTobacco.label>烟叶</VBE_RawTobacco.label>
  <!--EN: A simple cocktail quickly mixed from a duo of ingredients.-->
  <VBE_SimpleCocktail.description>一种简单的鸡尾酒由两种成分快速混合而成。</VBE_SimpleCocktail.description>
  <!--EN: simple cocktail-->
  <VBE_SimpleCocktail.label>简单鸡尾酒</VBE_SimpleCocktail.label>
  <!--EN: A very sweet and semi-citrusy beverage best enjoyed chilled. Whilst not exactly nutritious the sugar rush is welcomed and the effervescence is quite refreshing.-->
